# Partie main + appel de la fonction palindrome avec l'argument 32723 (plus grand palindrome accepté par le programme)
IT'S SHOWTIME
  DO IT NOW palindrome 32723
YOU HAVE BEEN TERMINATED 

# Déclaration de la fonction palindrome
LISTEN TO ME VERY CAREFULLY palindrome
  # et de l'argument pris par la fonction
  I NEED YOUR CLOTHES YOUR BOOTS AND YOUR MOTORCYCLE num 
  # Mot-clé utilisé pour préciser que la fonction retourne quelque chose
  GIVE THESE PEOPLE AIR 

  # Déclaration d'un entier
  HEY CHRISTMAS TREE r 
  # Et initialisation de sa valeur
    YOU SET US UP 0
    
  HEY CHRISTMAS TREE temp
    YOU SET US UP num
  HEY CHRISTMAS TREE temp10
    YOU SET US UP 0
    
  HEY CHRISTMAS TREE tempPositif
    YOU SET US UP @NO PROBLEMO  # @NO PROBLEMO correspond à true

  # Début d'une boucle while
  STICK AROUND tempPositif
  
    # Assignation d'une nouvelle valeur à temp10 (temp10 = temp%10)
    GET TO THE CHOPPER temp10
      HERE IS MY INVITATION temp
      I LET HIM GO 10
    ENOUGH TALK # Fin de l'assignation d'une nouvelle valeur

    # r = r * 10 + temp10
    GET TO THE CHOPPER r
      HERE IS MY INVITATION r
      YOU'RE FIRED 10
      GET UP temp10
    ENOUGH TALK

    # temp = temp/10
    GET TO THE CHOPPER temp
      HERE IS MY INVITATION temp
      HE HAD TO SPLIT 10
    ENOUGH TALK

    # tempPositif = temp > 0
    GET TO THE CHOPPER tempPositif
      HERE IS MY INVITATION temp
      LET OFF SOME STEAM BENNET 0
    ENOUGH TALK
  CHILL # Fin de la boucle while

  # Déclaration de la variable fin à la valeur true
  HEY CHRISTMAS TREE fin 
    YOU SET US UP @NO PROBLEMO

  # fin vaut true si r==num, false sinon  
  GET TO THE CHOPPER fin
    HERE IS MY INVITATION r
    YOU ARE NOT YOU YOU ARE ME num
  ENOUGH TALK

  # If fin
  BECAUSE I'M GOING TO SAY PLEASE fin
    # Print "This is a palindrome number"
    TALK TO THE HAND "This is a palindrome number"
  BULLSHIT # else
    # Print "This is a palindrome number"
    TALK TO THE HAND "This is not a palindrome number"
  YOU HAVE NO RESPECT FOR LOGIC # EndIf
  I'LL BE BACK fin # return fin
HASTA LA VISTA, BABY # fin de déclarationd de la méthode
